<title>UK: Willis Corroon expands interest in Brazil.</title>
<headline>Willis Corroon expands interest in Brazil.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK insurance broker Willis Corroon Group Plc said on Friday it had acquired all the outstanding shares in its Brazilian associate York Willis Corroon Corretores de Seguros SA.</p>
<p>No financial details of the transaction were given.</p>
<p>The group has held a 30 percent stake in York, the third largest insurance broker in Brazil, since 1990.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
